---
import { berryPhase, berryLoopModel } from '../../../data/part06/ch25TeachingModels.mjs';
const initialBerry = berryPhase(berryLoopModel.theta.default, berryLoopModel.gaugeWinding.default);
---

  <figure class="chapter-visual berry-gauge-loop" data-berry-gauge-loop>
    <figcaption>
      <strong>原创交互模型 B：Berry 相位的规范变化</strong>
      <span lang="en">Original interactive model B: gauge behavior of the Berry phase</span>
    </figcaption>

    <div class="chapter-visual__controls visual-controls--two">
      <label>
        <span>极角 θ | Polar angle</span>
        <input type="range" min="0" max={Math.PI} step={Math.PI / 100} value={Math.PI / 2} data-berry-theta />
        <output data-berry-theta-output>0.500π</output>
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>规范绕行 w | Gauge winding</span>
        <input type="range" min="-2" max="2" step="1" value="0" data-berry-winding />
        <output data-berry-winding-output>0</output>
      </label>
    </div>

    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 320" role="img" aria-labelledby="berry-title berry-desc">
      <title id="berry-title">Closed spinor loop and its gauge-dependent accumulated phase</title>
      <desc id="berry-desc">A latitude loop on a Bloch sphere is shown together with the geometric phase. Integer gauge winding changes the accumulated phase by multiples of two pi but leaves its complex exponential unchanged.</desc>
      <circle cx="220" cy="160" r="115" class="sphere-outline" />
      <ellipse cx="220" cy="160" rx="115" ry="38" class="sphere-equator" />
      <line x1="220" y1="35" x2="220" y2="285" class="visual-axis" />
      <ellipse cx="220" cy="160" rx="115" ry="38" class="berry-latitude" data-berry-latitude />
      <circle cx="335" cy="160" r="7" class="berry-point" data-berry-point />
      <path d="M420,85 A70,70 0 1 1 419.9,85" class="phase-ring" />
      <line x1="490" y1="155" x2="490" y2="95" class="phase-hand" data-berry-hand />
      <text x="220" y="305" text-anchor="middle">state ray on Bloch sphere</text>
      <text x="490" y="250" text-anchor="middle">exp(iγ)</text>
    </svg>

    <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
      <span data-berry-base>γ = {initialBerry.base.toFixed(4)}</span>
      <span data-berry-shifted>γ′ = {initialBerry.gaugeShifted.toFixed(4)}</span>
      <strong data-berry-invariant>exp(iγ′) = exp(iγ)</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
      <p><strong>状态回路：</strong><code>|u(φ)⟩ = cos(θ/2)|0⟩ + exp(iφ) sin(θ/2)|1⟩</code>，<code>0 ≤ φ ≤ 2π</code>。本站约定 <code>Aφ = i⟨u|∂φu⟩</code>，因此 <code>γ = −π(1−cos θ)</code>。</p>
      <p lang="en"><strong>State loop:</strong> <code>|u(φ)⟩ = cos(θ/2)|0⟩ + exp(iφ) sin(θ/2)|1⟩</code> for <code>0 ≤ φ ≤ 2π</code>. With <code>Aφ = i⟨u|∂φu⟩</code>, the phase is <code>γ = −π(1−cos θ)</code>.</p>
      <p><strong>验收：</strong>施加 <code>|u⟩ → exp(iwφ)|u⟩</code> 后，<code>γ′ = γ−2πw</code>，而 <code>exp(iγ′)=exp(iγ)</code>。<code>w</code> 必须为整数，才能保持闭合回路端点的单值条件。</p>
      <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> under <code>|u⟩ → exp(iwφ)|u⟩</code>, <code>γ′ = γ−2πw</code> while <code>exp(iγ′)=exp(iγ)</code>. Integer <code>w</code> is required for a single-valued endpoint gauge on the closed loop.</p>
      <p><strong>边界：</strong>这是参数空间中的二能级状态回路。它展示规范协变和模 <code>2π</code> 的不变量，不是特定晶体的 Bloch 能带，也没有单独给出 Chern 数。</p>
      <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> this is a two-level loop in parameter space. It demonstrates gauge covariance and the modulo-<code>2π</code> invariant; it is not a Bloch band of a specific crystal and does not by itself define a Chern number.</p>
    </div>
  </figure>

<script>
  import { berryPhase } from '../../../data/part06/ch25TeachingModels.mjs';
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-berry-gauge-loop]').forEach((root) => {
    const thetaInput = root.querySelector('[data-berry-theta]');
    const windingInput = root.querySelector('[data-berry-winding]');
    const thetaOutput = root.querySelector('[data-berry-theta-output]');
    const windingOutput = root.querySelector('[data-berry-winding-output]');
    const baseOutput = root.querySelector('[data-berry-base]');
    const shiftedOutput = root.querySelector('[data-berry-shifted]');
    const invariantOutput = root.querySelector('[data-berry-invariant]');
    const latitude = root.querySelector('[data-berry-latitude]');
    const point = root.querySelector('[data-berry-point]');
    const hand = root.querySelector('[data-berry-hand]');
    if (!(thetaInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(windingInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;

    const update = () => {
      const theta = Number(thetaInput.value);
      const winding = Number(windingInput.value);
      const result = berryPhase(theta, winding);
      const radiusX = 115 * Math.sin(theta);
      const radiusY = 38 * Math.sin(theta);
      const centerY = 160 - 92 * Math.cos(theta);
      const handX = 490 + 60 * Math.sin(result.gaugeShifted);
      const handY = 155 - 60 * Math.cos(result.gaugeShifted);

      if (thetaOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) thetaOutput.value = `${(theta / Math.PI).toFixed(3)}π`;
      if (windingOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) windingOutput.value = String(winding);
      if (baseOutput instanceof HTMLElement) baseOutput.textContent = `γ = ${result.base.toFixed(4)}`;
      if (shiftedOutput instanceof HTMLElement) shiftedOutput.textContent = `γ′ = ${result.gaugeShifted.toFixed(4)}`;
      if (invariantOutput instanceof HTMLElement) invariantOutput.textContent = `exp(iγ′) = ${result.invariant.re.toFixed(4)} ${result.invariant.im < 0 ? '−' : '+'} ${Math.abs(result.invariant.im).toFixed(4)}i`;
      if (latitude instanceof SVGEllipseElement) {
        latitude.setAttribute('cy', centerY.toFixed(2));
        latitude.setAttribute('rx', radiusX.toFixed(2));
        latitude.setAttribute('ry', radiusY.toFixed(2));
      }
      if (point instanceof SVGCircleElement) {
        point.setAttribute('cx', (220 + radiusX).toFixed(2));
        point.setAttribute('cy', centerY.toFixed(2));
      }
      if (hand instanceof SVGLineElement) {
        hand.setAttribute('x2', handX.toFixed(2));
        hand.setAttribute('y2', handY.toFixed(2));
      }
    };
    thetaInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    windingInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>
